<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Riyad Bank reports higher Q1 net profit.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Riyad Bank reports higher Q1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  238.75    vs    225.96</p>
<p> Operating income	  864.93    vs    871.70</p>
<p> Operating expenses	609.38    vs    626.74</p>
<p> Net operating profit    255.55    vs    244.97</p>
<p> Provisions		   30.30    vs     21.86</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity  7,560.67    vs  7,359.56</p>
<p> Total assets	   55,003.82    vs 53,081.20</p>
<p>Full Name: Riyad Bank.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom +973 536 187</p>
</text>
